tress-Buster!\nPlay HIT and take out your stress by pummelling, slapping, and whacking squishy clay heads in a VR sandbox. Thanks to our wild soft body physics, every hit deforms and reshapes the heads in hilariously unpredictable ways!  \n  \n{581241924916221}\n  \n# \ud83e\ude93Choose Your Weapon  \nFists, frying pans, baseball bats\u2014even a flopping fish!  \n  \n{1328852431700754}\n  \n# \ud83d\udc6430 Unique Heads to Wreck  \nEach one reacts to your hits with funny voices and expressions.  \n  \n{980958897475587}\n  \n# \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fChill Vibes:  \nDestroy in peace, surrounded by a tranquil paradise.  \n  \n{1079261667549812}\n  \n# \u2b50Development Roadmap  \n**100** store reviews = **3 new weapons** added  \n**1000** store reviews  =  **10 new clay models**  added (have your say on which!)  \n**10000** store reviews =  **upload your own clay models feature** added  \n  \n# Join our Discord and tell us what to add next: https://discord.gg/ay3PfTKzw3\n\n{605877485686349}\n", "short_description": "Smash, slap, and whack squishy clay heads in VR! Choose wild weapons like crowbars and guns, watch heads deform with soft body physics and hear the heads react to each blow. Play HIT, the ultimate stress relief tool!"}]}, "developer_name": "SUPER HYPER MEGA", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://superhypermega.studio/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SUPER HYPER MEGA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://superhypermega.studio/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommend